  "description": "Card Pyramid builds a house of playing cards at child scale. The triangular A-frame tower is Banana Yellow and red, with rope nets, a climbing wall and wavy holds on its faces. Children climb up one side, work out a route over the top and come down the other, which builds problem solving, strategy and body strength. There is sliding as well as climbing. The tower is narrow, with a product area of 12'7\" x 3'11\" and a safe play area of 17'7\" x 8'11\", and it takes up to 15 children aged 5 to 12. That slim shape lets a school fit it along a corridor of open ground. Its pipes, laminates and rope carry our 3-year warranty. Send us photos of the space.",
